  "_what_this_is": "BUILD #7 \u2014 a PRE-REGISTERED day filter for the Open Rider. Written down BEFORE the evidence, fixed for 60 forward sessions, and deliberately not tunable. The point is not the threshold; the point is that it was chosen in advance and cannot be moved to fit the result. Part 2 \u00a75 killed the searched version ('ODR causal day-classifier: REFUTED as searched') precisely because a filter found by searching a small sample is a story about that sample.",
